OL,3,GNEWSARobber crashes BMW into shop in
OL,4,Aram-raid robbery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA shop worker has described the "scary"
OL,7,Fmoment a robber nearly reversed into
OL,8,Fher as a car crashed through a window
OL,9,Fin a ram-raid robbery.
OL,11,FSummer Evans had been restocking
OL,12,Fshelves in the Cash Shop on Church
OL,13,FStreet in Bilston at around 09:30 GMT
OL,14,Fon Wednesday when a car burst through
OL,15,Fthe storefront.
OL,17,FA video captured a group of men
OL,18,Fstuffing items into an orange bag
OL,19,Fbefore the car fled the scene.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
