OL,3,GNEWSARobber crashes BMW into shop in
OL,4,Aram-raid robbery
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We're all a little bit shaken up. It
OL,7,Fwas really scary, we're all a little
OL,8,Fbit on edge today being back," Evans, a
OL,9,Fcustomer service representative, told
OL,10,Fthe BBC.
